1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,950
This is the Agreement
to Cancel the Allied Forces.

2
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:46,910
Let's send all the troops
back to their posts.

3
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:47,910
And this one

4
00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:50,610
is the Appointment Letter for
the New Commander of the Ninth Corps.

5
00:01:51,660 --> 00:01:52,500
Commander-in-Chief, please.

6
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,590
Yu Changxuan is hereby appointed

7
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:03,020
Commander of the Ninth Corps.

8
00:02:08,590 --> 00:02:10,490
You're appointing yourself

9
00:02:10,510 --> 00:02:12,590
as the Ninth Corps' new commander

10
00:02:13,490 --> 00:02:14,490
and expect me to sign it?

11
00:02:17,310 --> 00:02:18,080
I'm the best fit

12
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:20,740
for this position.

13
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,540
How dare you?

14
00:02:24,410 --> 00:02:25,080
Let me tell you.

15
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,750
Whatever your reason,

16
00:02:27,870 --> 00:02:30,470
threatening a superior means disloyalty.

17
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:32,070
It's a capital offense.

18
00:02:32,420 --> 00:02:33,590
Even if you execute me,

19
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,590
I'd still do it.

20
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,190
Fine.

21
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:42,760
Since childhood, in front of me,

22
00:02:42,770 --> 00:02:45,080
you've played a flawless act.

23
00:02:46,700 --> 00:02:48,240
You're quite the actor.

24
00:02:53,190 --> 00:02:54,280
I wasn't pretending.

25
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,800
From start to finish,

26
00:02:57,590 --> 00:02:59,240
you only had eyes for Yu Mingxuan.

27
00:03:01,980 --> 00:03:03,500
Have you ever really looked at me?

28
00:03:06,190 --> 00:03:08,020
I had high hopes for your
eldest brother.

29
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:08,800
What's wrong with that?

30
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:12,520
He was gifted and bold from boyhood.

31
00:03:13,370 --> 00:03:14,890
He endured hardship with ease

32
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:17,050
and carried our family's honor.

33
00:03:17,830 --> 00:03:18,870
As my eldest son,

34
00:03:19,260 --> 00:03:20,500
he honored his parents

35
00:03:21,070 --> 00:03:22,580
and cared for his siblings.

36
00:03:22,790 --> 00:03:24,280
If he were here today,

37
00:03:24,750 --> 00:03:26,080
he would never let you

38
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,230
defy me.

39
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:29,780
How could you ever compare to him?

40
00:03:37,090 --> 00:03:37,630
Yeah.

41
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:42,920
What was wrong with Mingxuan?

42
00:03:47,460 --> 00:03:48,730
He was perfect in every way.

43
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:52,310
But what good did that do?

44
00:03:55,110 --> 00:03:56,380
Heaven showed him no mercy.

45
00:03:58,580 --> 00:04:00,310
Your son, your greatest pride...

46
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,140
He's dead.

47
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:17,950
The Battle of Blackstone Shoal...

48
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,820
You must hate it more than anything.

49
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,270
You saved Mingxuan.

50
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:31,040
Why wasn't I the one who died?

51
00:04:33,470 --> 00:04:34,240
Why was it him?

52
00:04:38,190 --> 00:04:39,150
How did you find out?

53
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,860
Did you plan to hide it forever?

54
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:02,220
Hurry! Save him!

55
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:02,980
Help him!

56
00:05:03,510 --> 00:05:04,190
There's someone here!

57
00:05:04,410 --> 00:05:05,310
Bring the stretcher over!

58
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:05,800
Mingxuan!

59
00:05:06,630 --> 00:05:07,190
Mingxuan!

60
00:05:07,190 --> 00:05:07,870
Bring the stretcher over!

61
00:05:07,870 --> 00:05:08,310
Mingxuan!

62
00:05:09,330 --> 00:05:09,780
Mingxuan!

63
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:12,160
Commander-in-Chief, Changxuan is here!

64
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:14,210
Commander-in-Chief. Changxuan is here!

65
00:05:14,220 --> 00:05:15,130
Clear the rocks away!

66
00:05:16,050 --> 00:05:17,930
Commander-in-Chief, the Corps Commander
has been rescued.

67
00:05:20,010 --> 00:05:20,410
Catch!

68
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:23,810
Commander-in-Chief,
the situation's critical.

69
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,120
We have to retreat now.

70
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,300
We can't worry about that now.

71
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,740
Saving Mingxuan comes first.

72
00:05:27,990 --> 00:05:28,840
Get him down first.

73
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:29,700
Go, go!

74
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:30,560
Hurry!

75
00:05:38,450 --> 00:05:39,230
There's another one here.

76
00:05:48,650 --> 00:05:50,920
So, you were awake back then.

77
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:54,960
But all these years,

78
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:57,430
you never said a word.

79
00:06:01,450 --> 00:06:02,430
Once some things are said,

80
00:06:04,450 --> 00:06:05,430
how can we stay father and son?

81
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:10,640
I have nothing to explain.

82
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,150
Back then, I did choose

83
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,390
to save your brother.

84
00:06:18,580 --> 00:06:20,160
But under those circumstances,

85
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,260
I had no choice.

86
00:06:23,260 --> 00:06:23,950
It doesn't matter.

87
00:06:32,390 --> 00:06:33,730
I've long grown used to your coldness.

88
00:06:39,070 --> 00:06:40,040
I just want to say

89
00:06:41,390 --> 00:06:42,050
that I'll make the Ninth Corps

90
00:06:42,050 --> 00:06:43,590
a whole new force.

91
00:06:44,430 --> 00:06:45,360
As long as you approve,

92
00:06:46,450 --> 00:06:47,760
we can still be a loving father and son.

93
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,630
You'll still be

94
00:06:49,630 --> 00:06:50,700
the father I respect most.

95
00:06:56,460 --> 00:06:58,570
If we back out of the alliance,

96
00:07:00,260 --> 00:07:02,750
Chu Wenfu won't let it go.

97
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,220
Since I dared to do it,

98
00:07:04,540 --> 00:07:05,440
I must have thought it through.

99
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,100
If Chu Wenfu dares to make a move,

100
00:07:09,030 --> 00:07:09,870
I'll settle it all at once,

101
00:07:11,530 --> 00:07:12,330
from within or without.

102
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:45,970
Mr. Chu,

103
00:07:46,790 --> 00:07:47,680
after Yu Zhongquan was attacked,

104
00:07:47,780 --> 00:07:48,340
he sent word

105
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:49,220
to cancel the alliance.

106
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,120
What is this?

107
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,800
A modest household,

108
00:08:21,070 --> 00:08:22,480
yet posing as refined.

109
00:08:26,060 --> 00:08:27,000
What are you trying to do?

110
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,720
Mr. Yu and Ziyi

111
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,870
have fully made up.

112
00:08:31,430 --> 00:08:32,550
You're just a tool he used

113
00:08:32,550 --> 00:08:34,030
to provoke Ziyi.

114
00:08:35,030 --> 00:08:36,150
Stop shamelessly trying

115
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:37,580
to latch onto the Yu family.

116
00:08:40,710 --> 00:08:41,390
Ye Pingjun.

117
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,670
The most important thing in life

118
00:08:44,020 --> 00:08:46,160
is to know your place.

119
00:08:53,190 --> 00:08:53,800
Exactly.

120
00:08:55,030 --> 00:08:56,010
Just like you all,

121
00:08:56,770 --> 00:08:58,020
birds of a feather.

122
00:08:58,630 --> 00:08:59,490
Mind your own business.

123
00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:00,570
You insult Ziyi?

124
00:09:00,570 --> 00:09:01,480
How dare you insult her?

125
00:09:01,690 --> 00:09:02,390
Stop right there!

126
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:03,620
Don't go.

127
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:04,530
Let go!

128
00:09:28,540 --> 00:09:28,920
Changxuan,

129
00:09:29,970 --> 00:09:31,180
calling off the alliance

130
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,000
has stunned the veteran generals.

131
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:33,910
All kinds of rumors are flying.

132
00:09:34,950 --> 00:09:36,080
It's caused quite a stir.

133
00:09:46,900 --> 00:09:47,920
Let them talk.

134
00:09:51,190 --> 00:09:52,590
How did Chu Wenfu react?

135
00:09:54,250 --> 00:09:55,030
Just as you expected.

136
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,320
Chu Wenfu

137
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,270
has sent two brigades

138
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,470
toward the Lishui River.

139
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:03,490
Something's happened.

140
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,650
Something's happened!

141
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:05,590
Something terrible has happened.

142
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,330
This time, it's real.

143
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:08,670
Why are you panicking?

144
00:10:09,740 --> 00:10:10,910
It's Miss Ye.

145
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,120
What happened to Miss Ye?

146
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,220
The Tao family

147
00:10:15,220 --> 00:10:16,440
has taken Miss Ye away.

148
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:29,390
You're so young,

149
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:30,790
yet so vicious.

150
00:10:31,500 --> 00:10:33,270
How dare you hurt my daughter's face?

151
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:35,080
You went way too far.

152
00:10:37,710 --> 00:10:39,420
If she hadn't stirred up trouble,

153
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:41,390
she wouldn't have been hurt.

154
00:10:41,670 --> 00:10:42,470
Right now,

155
00:10:42,470 --> 00:10:43,620
even kneeling before my daughter

156
00:10:43,620 --> 00:10:44,850
and apologizing won't be enough.

157
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:46,520
Yet, you still dare to make excuses?

158
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,160
Since your parents

159
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:49,510
never taught you manners,

160
00:10:49,730 --> 00:10:50,320
then today,

161
00:10:51,010 --> 00:10:52,400
I'll teach you myself.

162
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:29,300
Do you admit you were wrong?

163
00:11:37,980 --> 00:11:39,120
I did nothing wrong.

164
00:11:41,780 --> 00:11:43,520
I've given you so many chances.

165
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,520
You threw them all away.

166
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,750
Then, don't blame me.

167
00:11:55,470 --> 00:11:55,850
Milord!

168
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,300
Someone's here with troops.

169
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:04,610
Put the gun down.

170
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:12,760
You...

171
00:12:13,530 --> 00:12:14,300
You seem to be

172
00:12:14,300 --> 00:12:15,840
one of Yu Changxuan's men, am I right?

173
00:12:21,820 --> 00:12:22,090
You...

174
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:44,460
Stop.

175
00:12:47,030 --> 00:12:48,470
She hurt my daughter's face.

176
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:49,750
No one's taking her

177
00:12:49,750 --> 00:12:50,760
out of here today.

178
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:53,060
I'm taking her with me today.

179
00:12:54,030 --> 00:12:55,520
How dare you speak to me like that?

180
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:59,620
Is this what Yu Changxuan wants?

181
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:07,120
Miss Ye is the copyist for Lanqing

182
00:13:07,130 --> 00:13:08,360
of Yuchun Theatre.

183
00:13:09,100 --> 00:13:09,890
I was instructed

184
00:13:10,380 --> 00:13:11,140
to bring her back.

185
00:13:12,290 --> 00:13:13,500
A mere performer

186
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:15,600
dared to obstruct my work.

187
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:17,450
President Tao, you kidnapped her

188
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,370
and tortured her in private.

189
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,860
If it's pursued,

190
00:13:21,370 --> 00:13:22,660
the Tao name may suffer.

191
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:26,080
But she wounded my daughter's face.

192
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,000
What are you going to do about that?

193
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:28,580
That's all the more reason

194
00:13:29,060 --> 00:13:29,820
to take her back for questioning

195
00:13:30,290 --> 00:13:31,140
and give you an answer.

196
00:13:33,350 --> 00:13:33,620
You...

197
00:13:46,830 --> 00:13:47,220
Return to base!

198
00:14:01,930 --> 00:14:03,910
My news was timely enough, right?

199
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,830
But you and Ye Pingjun

200
00:14:07,830 --> 00:14:08,940
were just acting.

201
00:14:08,950 --> 00:14:09,390
No need

202
00:14:09,390 --> 00:14:10,640
to fall out with the Taos

203
00:14:10,650 --> 00:14:12,060
over a mere schoolgirl.

204
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,390
She got dragged into this

205
00:14:15,670 --> 00:14:16,750
because of us.

206
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:18,630
Saving her this time

207
00:14:19,710 --> 00:14:20,730
settles the favor we owe.

208
00:14:21,740 --> 00:14:22,670
Since when did you become

209
00:14:22,670 --> 00:14:23,820
so kind-hearted?

210
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:26,500
Drive.

211
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:46,500
Bingwen,

212
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:48,080
when does the Commander-in-Chief arrive?

213
00:14:49,010 --> 00:14:50,110
I spoke to him this morning.

214
00:14:50,510 --> 00:14:50,900
Just wait.

215
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:54,050
If we formed the alliance, why break it?

216
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,040
Now,

217
00:14:55,330 --> 00:14:57,080
two full brigades of the Chu Army

218
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,370
are stationed by the Lishui River,

219
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,630
setting up machine guns
and fortifications.

220
00:15:01,830 --> 00:15:04,300
Isn't it obvious they're going to
open fire?

221
00:15:04,910 --> 00:15:05,470
If we fight,

222
00:15:05,890 --> 00:15:07,670
he's the Military Governor, after all.

223
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:09,590
But if we don't fight,

224
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:10,480
are we supposed

225
00:15:10,540 --> 00:15:12,040
to just give away our troops
for nothing?

226
00:15:12,390 --> 00:15:13,040
We must fight.

227
00:15:13,060 --> 00:15:13,920
We must fight.

228
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:15,420
We must fight.

229
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:18,580
Gentlemen,

230
00:15:19,210 --> 00:15:20,010
settle down.

231
00:15:20,390 --> 00:15:20,870
Shut up.

232
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:22,510
Don't you know

233
00:15:22,650 --> 00:15:24,940
that I have troops by
the Lishui River too?

234
00:15:25,700 --> 00:15:27,720
You petty pedants.

235
00:15:28,100 --> 00:15:29,000
You always hide

236
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:30,510
in your offices like cowards.

237
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:31,440
Feng Sanli!

238
00:15:32,110 --> 00:15:34,220
This isn't your little fiefdom

239
00:15:34,220 --> 00:15:35,290
to raise your voice in.

240
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:37,740
Guns speak their own logic;

241
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:40,310
the dead serve their duty.

242
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,320
Who among you can guarantee

243
00:15:43,100 --> 00:15:44,410
the Chu Army won't fire first?

244
00:15:45,110 --> 00:15:46,110
Who can take responsibility

245
00:15:46,110 --> 00:15:47,990
if the Yu Army suffers losses?

246
00:15:48,710 --> 00:15:50,180
And who can guarantee

247
00:15:50,620 --> 00:15:52,530
the Chu Army won't occupy Nanhuai?

248
00:15:52,980 --> 00:15:53,510
I can.

249
00:16:13,980 --> 00:16:15,490
Why is Mr. Yu here? Why are they here?

250
00:16:15,650 --> 00:16:16,830
Why hasn't the Commander-in-Chief come?

251
00:16:17,270 --> 00:16:18,300
What's he doing here?

252
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:18,910
Yeah.

253
00:16:19,060 --> 00:16:20,200
Shouldn't the Commander-in-Chief
be here?

254
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:37,820
Today's meeting

255
00:16:38,680 --> 00:16:39,500
will be chaired by me.

256
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:47,040
Sit.

257
00:16:57,220 --> 00:16:57,770
Mr. Yu,

258
00:16:58,660 --> 00:17:00,380
are you joking with us?

259
00:17:01,380 --> 00:17:02,770
This is a military affairs meeting.

260
00:17:04,290 --> 00:17:05,350
By the Commander-in-Chief's order,

261
00:17:05,900 --> 00:17:06,610
I take command

262
00:17:07,060 --> 00:17:08,730
of the Ninth Corps from today on.

263
00:17:09,550 --> 00:17:10,350
The Commander-in-Chief is unwell.

264
00:17:11,090 --> 00:17:12,080
For the next two months,

265
00:17:12,470 --> 00:17:13,780
all army affairs

266
00:17:14,310 --> 00:17:15,350
will be handled by me.

267
00:17:17,050 --> 00:17:19,080
Why would the Commander-in-Chief
pick him?

268
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:21,840
The Chu troops massed at
the Lishui River.

269
00:17:22,780 --> 00:17:23,630
I already have a plan for that.

270
00:17:27,870 --> 00:17:28,360
Changxuan,

271
00:17:28,950 --> 00:17:29,660
you know the opera,

272
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:30,940
but how much do you know

273
00:17:31,770 --> 00:17:32,760
of commanding troops?

274
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:36,750
By ten o'clock,

275
00:17:38,380 --> 00:17:39,820
Chu Wenfu will withdraw.

276
00:17:40,030 --> 00:17:40,800
Ten o'clock...

277
00:17:40,950 --> 00:17:41,620
He'll withdraw?

278
00:17:41,770 --> 00:17:42,370
I don't believe it.

279
00:17:43,330 --> 00:17:44,790
The Chu Army moved in force.

280
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:47,180
How could they leave empty-handed?

281
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:48,410
Let's bet on it, then.

282
00:17:48,740 --> 00:17:49,520
You're on.

283
00:17:49,820 --> 00:17:50,440
If you lose,

284
00:17:50,890 --> 00:17:51,570
back to the General Staff.

285
00:17:52,070 --> 00:17:53,070
If you win,

286
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:54,880
I'll accept you as the Corps Commander.

287
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:55,590
Deal.

288
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:07,240
What kind of man is
Military Governor Chu?

289
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:08,880
How could he just withdraw like that?

290
00:18:09,650 --> 00:18:10,780
The alliance is essential.

291
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:11,730
How could he withdraw the troops?

292
00:18:11,730 --> 00:18:12,620
That's impossible.

293
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:14,680
It's just impossible.

294
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:15,820
What on earth was he thinking?

295
00:18:16,790 --> 00:18:18,310
And in such a short time?

296
00:18:18,310 --> 00:18:19,030
Exactly.

297
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:21,590
Report, Brigadier Feng.

298
00:18:22,490 --> 00:18:22,880
Come in.

299
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,060
Brigadier Feng,

300
00:18:27,510 --> 00:18:28,480
a telegram came from the Lishui River.

301
00:18:28,570 --> 00:18:29,930
The Third Corps of the Chu Army
has set out,

302
00:18:30,070 --> 00:18:30,920
heading upstream along the Lishui River.

303
00:18:31,010 --> 00:18:31,480
Well?

304
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:34,200
Is this your retreat?

305
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:36,040
Brigadier Feng,

306
00:18:36,740 --> 00:18:37,970
the Chu Army isn't attacking.

307
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:40,590
They're retreating toward Jinzhou.

308
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:42,260
They really are retreating.

309
00:18:42,260 --> 00:18:43,420
How did Mr. Yu know?

310
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:44,380
Right. How did he know?

311
00:18:44,380 --> 00:18:44,880
Exactly.

312
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,800
How did he learn of this?

313
00:18:47,330 --> 00:18:47,970
Retreat?

314
00:18:48,380 --> 00:18:48,680
Yes.

315
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:51,610
Get out.

316
00:18:53,630 --> 00:18:54,260
Brigadier Feng,

317
00:18:54,950 --> 00:18:55,530
please sit.

318
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:04,200
Mr. Cheng has confirmed it.

319
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:06,990
Chu Wenfu used the alliance's name

320
00:19:07,430 --> 00:19:08,780
to deploy the Yu Army's elite

321
00:19:09,140 --> 00:19:10,220
and secretly build up troops.

322
00:19:11,180 --> 00:19:13,390
Mr. Cheng rebuked Chu himself.

323
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:14,840
Chu Wenfu

324
00:19:15,520 --> 00:19:16,210
had no choice but to retreat.

325
00:19:17,580 --> 00:19:19,460
Mr. Cheng is far away in Huaijing.

326
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:21,540
How would he know?

327
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:24,440
Chu Wenfu did have ulterior motives.

328
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,650
How would he know all this?

329
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,180
Yeah, yeah.

330
00:19:29,580 --> 00:19:31,160
Even if the Chu Army withdrew,

331
00:19:31,830 --> 00:19:33,410
the grudge is already there.

332
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:34,900
Mr. Yu,

333
00:19:35,590 --> 00:19:36,110
how will you

334
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:37,920
handle that?

335
00:19:39,190 --> 00:19:40,220
The central government

336
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:41,810
changes by the day.

337
00:19:42,420 --> 00:19:43,280
The Cheng-Xu war

338
00:19:44,050 --> 00:19:44,880
could go either way,

339
00:19:46,400 --> 00:19:47,730
and the Yu Army is picking sides.

340
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:50,560
Must we rise and fall with them?

341
00:19:51,340 --> 00:19:52,560
Even if you back the right person,

342
00:19:53,120 --> 00:19:54,000
how long can your glory last?

343
00:19:55,100 --> 00:19:55,880
My esteemed uncles and elders,

344
00:19:57,310 --> 00:19:57,920
you fought bloody battles

345
00:19:58,400 --> 00:19:59,420
and carved out this territory

346
00:20:00,780 --> 00:20:02,700
with your own blood and sweat.

347
00:20:04,180 --> 00:20:05,390
Do you deserve only

348
00:20:05,390 --> 00:20:06,880
to scrape by in the cracks?

349
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:09,300
What the Yu Army wants

350
00:20:10,110 --> 00:20:11,260
and what I want

351
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:12,940
isn't to lean on others.

352
00:20:13,990 --> 00:20:14,830
It's to stand on our own.

353
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,060
Mr. Chu,

354
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:27,990
on Mr. Cheng's orders,

355
00:20:28,310 --> 00:20:29,720
the troops sent to the Lishui River

356
00:20:29,860 --> 00:20:30,710
have all been withdrawn.

357
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:49,730
You're not fishing today?

358
00:20:51,350 --> 00:20:52,960
Wipe the rod dry,

359
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:53,760
oil it well,

360
00:20:55,410 --> 00:20:57,670
and store it safe and sound

361
00:20:58,480 --> 00:20:59,220
for later use.

362
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,030
Yes.

363
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:36,830
I won't pawn it.

364
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:54,080
Mother,

365
00:21:55,070 --> 00:21:56,700
we once had a jade pendant

366
00:21:57,150 --> 00:21:59,030
with a bamboo leaf pattern carved on it.

367
00:21:59,180 --> 00:21:59,910
Do you remember?

368
00:22:02,590 --> 00:22:03,200
Oh, that one.

369
00:22:04,100 --> 00:22:05,580
The year before last, the roof leaked.

370
00:22:06,070 --> 00:22:06,920
To fix the roof,

371
00:22:07,420 --> 00:22:08,250
I pawned it.

372
00:22:11,350 --> 00:22:12,160
Why the sudden question

373
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:12,980
about this?

374
00:22:14,480 --> 00:22:15,650
Today, when I was out,

375
00:22:15,830 --> 00:22:16,760
I happened to see one

376
00:22:16,770 --> 00:22:17,770
that looked pretty similar,

377
00:22:18,160 --> 00:22:19,050
so I came to ask you.

378
00:22:28,090 --> 00:22:29,550
Those are just material things.

379
00:22:30,320 --> 00:22:31,080
They don't matter.

380
00:22:31,820 --> 00:22:33,700
What matters is the two of us

381
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:35,910
living a steady life.

382
00:22:44,910 --> 00:22:45,260
Mr. Yu,

383
00:22:45,560 --> 00:22:46,330
did you see that just now?

384
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:48,200
Those old generals

385
00:22:48,200 --> 00:22:49,740
all wore sour faces,

386
00:22:49,830 --> 00:22:50,850
quite ugly indeed.

387
00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:52,730
The worst is yet to come.

388
00:22:53,230 --> 00:22:53,960
Starting today,

389
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:55,700
the Ninth Corps restores discipline.

390
00:22:55,860 --> 00:22:56,610
Violations will be punished.

391
00:22:57,320 --> 00:22:58,520
We'll found an Officers' Academy.

392
00:22:58,910 --> 00:23:00,000
Officers of company rank and above

393
00:23:00,340 --> 00:23:01,100
face regular evaluations.

394
00:23:01,490 --> 00:23:02,180
Those who fail

395
00:23:02,440 --> 00:23:03,110
will be dismissed.

396
00:23:03,620 --> 00:23:04,010
Yes.

397
00:23:04,860 --> 00:23:06,270
The army's senior leadership

398
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:07,790
is riddled with corruption

399
00:23:07,800 --> 00:23:08,710
and systematic exploitation.

400
00:23:09,020 --> 00:23:10,100
If the soldiers can't even
eat their fill,

401
00:23:10,100 --> 00:23:10,760
how can they be loyal?

402
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:11,880
Ruitong,

403
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:14,050
according to the list I gave you,

404
00:23:14,280 --> 00:23:15,630
check these officers' finances,

405
00:23:15,850 --> 00:23:16,650
their families' accounts,

406
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:18,550
and their pawnshop deposits,

407
00:23:19,150 --> 00:23:19,680
including

408
00:23:19,920 --> 00:23:20,880
storefront leases and such.

409
00:23:21,140 --> 00:23:21,700
Don't miss a thing.

410
00:23:22,160 --> 00:23:22,560
Understood.

411
00:23:23,040 --> 00:23:23,660
Yu Changxuan.

412
00:23:29,080 --> 00:23:29,720
This is bad.

413
00:23:31,020 --> 00:23:32,380
What's coming can't be avoided.

414
00:23:37,900 --> 00:23:38,410
Ziyi,

415
00:23:39,090 --> 00:23:39,820
what brings you here?

416
00:23:40,800 --> 00:23:41,680
You could've just called me.

417
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:42,680
I would've driven over to get you.

418
00:23:44,130 --> 00:23:45,220
No need to trouble yourself.

419
00:23:47,250 --> 00:23:49,100
Ye Pingjun hurt my face.

420
00:23:49,680 --> 00:23:50,920
My father stepped in to teach her
a lesson.

421
00:23:51,460 --> 00:23:53,140
But Director Gu,

422
00:23:53,810 --> 00:23:56,040
why did you send troops to rescue her?

423
00:23:58,130 --> 00:23:58,710
Ruitong,

424
00:24:00,960 --> 00:24:01,920
did that really happen?

425
00:24:03,210 --> 00:24:03,590
Yes.

426
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:06,590
Director Gu,

427
00:24:07,520 --> 00:24:08,600
I find it rather odd.

428
00:24:09,720 --> 00:24:10,600
Is it true

429
00:24:10,660 --> 00:24:12,630
that a mere performer like Lanqing

430
00:24:13,440 --> 00:24:14,580
can order you around?

431
00:24:15,940 --> 00:24:17,120
Or is she just

432
00:24:18,380 --> 00:24:19,350
someone else's cover?

433
00:24:24,210 --> 00:24:24,970
Miss Tao,

434
00:24:25,740 --> 00:24:27,380
you got that exactly right.

435
00:24:27,600 --> 00:24:28,970
It is indeed a cover.

436
00:24:29,810 --> 00:24:30,460
But

437
00:24:31,510 --> 00:24:32,540
it's not Mr. Yu's.

438
00:24:33,020 --> 00:24:34,120
It's Gu's.

439
00:24:40,110 --> 00:24:40,800
What do you mean?

440
00:24:41,600 --> 00:24:42,480
At this point,

441
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:45,070
I know I can't hide it from you.

442
00:24:45,880 --> 00:24:47,780
So, I might as well tell you the truth.

443
00:24:48,030 --> 00:24:49,000
We're practically family, anyway.

444
00:24:49,180 --> 00:24:49,520
Right?

445
00:24:50,700 --> 00:24:52,170
Come, let's talk in private.

446
00:24:58,980 --> 00:24:59,870
Let me tell you.

447
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:01,250
Actually, Gu

448
00:25:02,190 --> 00:25:03,400
has had his eye on Miss Ye

449
00:25:03,400 --> 00:25:04,680
for a long time.

450
00:25:06,910 --> 00:25:07,750
Li Boren,

451
00:25:07,920 --> 00:25:09,530
have you watched too many dramas?

452
00:25:09,840 --> 00:25:10,920
Now, you're putting on a show for me?

453
00:25:11,280 --> 00:25:12,640
Why would I lie to you about this?

454
00:25:12,730 --> 00:25:13,900
If you don't believe me, then...

455
00:25:14,480 --> 00:25:14,810
Gu,

456
00:25:15,530 --> 00:25:16,260
tell her yourself.

457
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:20,780
Go on.

458
00:25:24,540 --> 00:25:25,120
Miss Tao,

459
00:25:26,390 --> 00:25:27,580
my apologies.

460
00:25:28,200 --> 00:25:28,920
Saving Miss Ye

461
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:29,860
was truly my own wish.

462
00:25:34,020 --> 00:25:34,720
Gu Ruitong,

463
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,720
you kept me completely in the dark.

464
00:25:37,790 --> 00:25:39,270
How could you do this, Gu?

465
00:25:42,760 --> 00:25:43,480
I acted on my own.

466
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:44,720
Please punish me as you see fit.

467
00:25:45,900 --> 00:25:46,200
Mr. Yu.

468
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:46,730
Forget it. Forget it.

469
00:25:47,030 --> 00:25:47,350
Let it slide.

470
00:25:50,290 --> 00:25:50,870
Director Gu,

471
00:25:51,680 --> 00:25:52,740
I never saw that coming.

472
00:25:53,280 --> 00:25:55,850
I usually see you with a gun
and a blade.

473
00:25:56,060 --> 00:25:56,660
I've never seen you

474
00:25:56,660 --> 00:25:58,150
take an interest in any girl.

475
00:25:58,670 --> 00:26:00,650
Ye Pingjun is really something.

476
00:26:02,390 --> 00:26:03,480
As the saying goes,

477
00:26:04,410 --> 00:26:05,880
what girl doesn't yearn for romance?

478
00:26:06,270 --> 00:26:08,080
What young man doesn't fall in love?

479
00:26:08,330 --> 00:26:08,710
Right?

480
00:26:09,250 --> 00:26:10,110
Gu is

481
00:26:10,290 --> 00:26:11,700
just slower than most men

482
00:26:11,920 --> 00:26:13,540
to catch on.

483
00:26:13,680 --> 00:26:14,050
Right?

484
00:26:17,680 --> 00:26:18,210
I don't care.

485
00:26:20,650 --> 00:26:21,910
Your man made a mistake.

486
00:26:22,250 --> 00:26:23,500
I can't punish him,

487
00:26:25,360 --> 00:26:26,120
so I'll punish you.

488
00:26:27,160 --> 00:26:27,630
How?

489
00:26:29,110 --> 00:26:30,580
By making you

490
00:26:31,970 --> 00:26:32,650
watch a movie with me.

491
00:26:35,370 --> 00:26:36,040
You pick the time.

492
00:26:36,140 --> 00:26:36,640
I'll go pick you up.

493
00:26:52,660 --> 00:26:54,350
I had someone bring chuanbei
from Sichuan.

494
00:26:54,350 --> 00:26:56,260
It's ground to powder

495
00:26:56,900 --> 00:26:59,030
and stewed with snow pear
and rock sugar.

496
00:26:59,640 --> 00:27:02,530
The doctor says one bowl a day

497
00:27:02,930 --> 00:27:05,790
can soothe the lungs and temper
the liver.

498
00:27:08,900 --> 00:27:09,550
What is it?

499
00:27:11,570 --> 00:27:12,020
Nothing.

500
00:27:13,180 --> 00:27:14,270
It's late at night.

501
00:27:15,360 --> 00:27:17,360
Why do you look so troubled?

502
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:19,010
Who says I'm troubled?

503
00:27:21,140 --> 00:27:22,900
Can anything between you and your son

504
00:27:22,910 --> 00:27:24,720
ever escape my notice?

505
00:27:26,110 --> 00:27:26,640
Go on.

506
00:27:27,410 --> 00:27:29,410
Why suddenly hand the Ninth Corps

507
00:27:31,060 --> 00:27:32,130
to Changxuan?

508
00:27:37,880 --> 00:27:38,630
Baoru,

509
00:27:41,370 --> 00:27:42,440
there are things

510
00:27:44,920 --> 00:27:46,070
you truly don't know.

511
00:27:54,340 --> 00:27:56,110
Why tell me only now?

512
00:27:57,060 --> 00:27:58,900
Because only now did you learn

513
00:28:00,080 --> 00:28:02,480
that Changxuan knew long ago that
his father

514
00:28:03,330 --> 00:28:04,650
had abandoned him to die.

515
00:28:05,760 --> 00:28:06,400
So,

516
00:28:07,430 --> 00:28:08,360
you have nothing to hide

517
00:28:08,360 --> 00:28:10,120
from me anymore, right?

518
00:28:13,870 --> 00:28:15,570
Mingxuan was your eldest son,

519
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:18,840
the heir you carefully groomed.

520
00:28:18,840 --> 00:28:20,020
He couldn't die.

521
00:28:21,160 --> 00:28:22,590
But when it came to Changxuan,

522
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:26,900
you chose to sacrifice the lesser.

523
00:28:27,860 --> 00:28:29,070
In that situation,

524
00:28:29,070 --> 00:28:30,450
I could only save one.

525
00:28:31,370 --> 00:28:32,650
I had to protect the future commander

526
00:28:32,660 --> 00:28:33,730
of the Yu Army.

527
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:36,560
This isn't about father and son.

528
00:28:37,590 --> 00:28:38,440
This is war.

529
00:28:38,840 --> 00:28:39,590
This is politics.

530
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:52,910
Our military-political marriage alliance

531
00:28:53,160 --> 00:28:54,720
has lasted for nearly thirty years.

532
00:28:57,320 --> 00:28:58,400
Your position,

533
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:00,330
your difficulties,

534
00:29:01,160 --> 00:29:02,280
your ruthlessness...

535
00:29:02,550 --> 00:29:04,010
I understand it all too well.

536
00:29:04,570 --> 00:29:07,060
I don't complain or dwell on it.

537
00:29:07,670 --> 00:29:09,740
I'm just a mother.

538
00:29:10,600 --> 00:29:11,700
All I hope for

539
00:29:12,600 --> 00:29:15,840
is that we show our children more love.

540
00:29:17,750 --> 00:29:19,550
But for the entire Yu Army,

541
00:29:20,190 --> 00:29:21,390
for all of Nanhuai,

542
00:29:22,670 --> 00:29:23,800
we first have to be

543
00:29:23,800 --> 00:29:25,210
the Commander-in-Chief and his wife.

544
00:29:26,380 --> 00:29:27,630
Only behind closed doors

545
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:31,310
can we be parents.

546
00:30:20,330 --> 00:30:22,380
Father, I've come to see you.

547
00:30:23,160 --> 00:30:24,160
School let out late today.

548
00:30:24,640 --> 00:30:25,710
You didn't wait too long, did you?

549
00:30:27,470 --> 00:30:28,480
Yesterday evening,

550
00:30:28,860 --> 00:30:30,680
kids sang nursery rhymes outside
our home.

551
00:30:31,020 --> 00:30:31,780
They were beautiful.

552
00:30:33,580 --> 00:30:35,300
In class, my literature teacher

553
00:30:35,300 --> 00:30:36,430
read the poem I wrote.

554
00:30:37,460 --> 00:30:38,870
He said I'm really talented.

555
00:30:39,240 --> 00:30:40,550
He encouraged me to keep writing.

556
00:30:41,750 --> 00:30:42,890
Maybe one day,

557
00:30:43,500 --> 00:30:44,720
my writing will appear

558
00:30:44,830 --> 00:30:45,830
in the papers.

559
00:30:56,240 --> 00:30:56,640
Father,

560
00:30:58,310 --> 00:30:59,280
I miss you so much.

561
00:31:41,520 --> 00:31:42,220
See that?

562
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,440
I can do everything

563
00:31:46,870 --> 00:31:47,680
that you could.

564
00:31:50,020 --> 00:31:51,460
And I'll do it better.

565
00:31:53,680 --> 00:31:54,920
I want you to watch closely

566
00:31:56,950 --> 00:31:58,840
as I take Sujing down

567
00:32:00,250 --> 00:32:01,330
step by step.

568
00:32:20,970 --> 00:32:21,700
Yu Mingxuan,

569
00:32:22,910 --> 00:32:24,400
how could you die like this?

570
00:32:25,600 --> 00:32:27,200
We never settled who was better.

571
00:32:27,350 --> 00:32:29,150
I haven't shown Father I'm stronger.

572
00:32:30,030 --> 00:32:31,100
You're a coward.

573
00:32:31,740 --> 00:32:32,430
A gutless coward.

574
00:32:32,750 --> 00:32:34,470
You're afraid I'll beat you.

575
00:32:48,940 --> 00:32:49,380
Father,

576
00:32:51,010 --> 00:32:52,060
I miss you so much.

577
00:32:54,390 --> 00:32:55,820
I know you've become

578
00:32:55,820 --> 00:32:57,830
the brightest star in the sky,

579
00:32:59,130 --> 00:33:00,210
always watching over us,

580
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:02,530
never once leaving us.

581
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:07,000
It's all just self-deceiving nonsense.

582
00:33:07,780 --> 00:33:09,260
Dead is dead.

583
00:33:10,110 --> 00:33:11,150
It all turns to ash.

584
00:33:12,720 --> 00:33:13,640
There's nothing left.

585
00:33:25,830 --> 00:33:27,130
Are you here to visit a loved one too?

586
00:33:29,510 --> 00:33:29,900
No.

587
00:33:31,070 --> 00:33:32,200
He's someone I hate.

588
00:33:34,980 --> 00:33:36,270
If you hate him,

589
00:33:37,150 --> 00:33:38,710
why light an ever-burning lamp?

590
00:33:44,270 --> 00:33:45,250
You must miss him a lot.

591
00:33:46,600 --> 00:33:48,290
Is he a family member you loved deeply?

592
00:33:48,690 --> 00:33:49,160
I don't miss him.

593
00:33:52,290 --> 00:33:52,710
I don't love him.

594
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:05,910
This little yellow flower is lovely.

595
00:34:08,100 --> 00:34:09,510
It's clearly picked with care.

596
00:34:20,850 --> 00:34:22,320
Pretending not to love someone

597
00:34:23,520 --> 00:34:24,430
is painful.

598
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:51,140
The body returns to the earth,

599
00:34:53,240 --> 00:34:54,550
but true feelings never fade.

600
00:35:06,420 --> 00:35:06,940
One.

601
00:35:07,650 --> 00:35:08,430
Kill!

602
00:35:08,600 --> 00:35:09,280
Two.

603
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:10,140
Kill!

604
00:35:10,140 --> 00:35:10,900
Turn left!

605
00:35:12,230 --> 00:35:12,880
Hi, Corps Commander!

606
00:35:13,530 --> 00:35:13,990
Fire!

607
00:35:18,100 --> 00:35:18,400
Don't move!

608
00:35:26,980 --> 00:35:27,350
Keep up!

609
00:35:30,220 --> 00:35:31,090
Come on, move up.

610
00:35:32,680 --> 00:35:33,360
Hi, Corps Commander!

611
00:35:38,230 --> 00:35:38,960
What are you doing?

612
00:35:39,100 --> 00:35:39,820
Don't move!

613
00:35:43,150 --> 00:35:43,590
Hi, Corps Commander!

614
00:35:51,400 --> 00:35:51,880
What do you want?

615
00:35:53,550 --> 00:35:54,230
Let go of me!

616
00:35:56,110 --> 00:35:57,710
What on earth is this?

617
00:35:58,040 --> 00:35:58,900
I can't make any sense of it.

618
00:35:59,590 --> 00:36:00,510
What is this?

619
00:36:00,880 --> 00:36:01,800
Kill!

620
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:03,590
Left, right, left.

621
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:10,520
Oh, right, Pingjun.

622
00:36:11,520 --> 00:36:12,420
How's your injury healing?

623
00:36:13,050 --> 00:36:14,010
Almost back to normal.

624
00:36:14,760 --> 00:36:15,450
Lanqing,

625
00:36:16,100 --> 00:36:17,830
thank you for asking Director Gu
to save me.

626
00:36:18,300 --> 00:36:18,980
Otherwise

627
00:36:19,530 --> 00:36:20,490
I really don't know

628
00:36:20,490 --> 00:36:21,850
how I'd have gotten out in one piece.

629
00:36:23,070 --> 00:36:24,340
You don't need to thank me.

630
00:36:30,550 --> 00:36:31,440
But Pingjun,

631
00:36:32,320 --> 00:36:33,400
after you resigned,

632
00:36:33,920 --> 00:36:35,330
I don't even have a close friend

633
00:36:35,330 --> 00:36:35,920
to confide in.

634
00:36:39,720 --> 00:36:40,360
Don't worry.

635
00:36:40,860 --> 00:36:42,150
I'll visit you often.

636
00:36:46,330 --> 00:36:46,960
I'll walk you out.

637
00:36:49,120 --> 00:36:49,720
You can't leave.

638
00:36:50,320 --> 00:36:50,860
How could you

639
00:36:50,860 --> 00:36:51,990
quit halfway through writing?

640
00:36:52,190 --> 00:36:53,460
That's completely irresponsible.

641
00:36:53,720 --> 00:36:54,860
It's not that I'm quitting.

642
00:36:55,140 --> 00:36:55,790
Threat letters

643
00:36:55,900 --> 00:36:57,080
have been sent to my home.

644
00:36:57,360 --> 00:36:58,490
I really have no choice.

645
00:36:59,060 --> 00:37:00,730
You'd better find someone else.

646
00:37:03,070 --> 00:37:03,570
Ruoru,

647
00:37:04,540 --> 00:37:04,920
let him go.

648
00:37:05,550 --> 00:37:06,710
Director Liang, Ruoru.

649
00:37:07,360 --> 00:37:07,770
Lanqing.

650
00:37:08,220 --> 00:37:08,930
What happened?

651
00:37:09,460 --> 00:37:10,280
On Nanhuai's outskirts,

652
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:10,880
there's a group of women

653
00:37:10,880 --> 00:37:12,200
and children who have fled here.

654
00:37:12,630 --> 00:37:14,300
The Charity Union will soon vote

655
00:37:14,300 --> 00:37:15,710
on whether to take them in.

656
00:37:16,340 --> 00:37:17,670
We planned to win support

657
00:37:17,800 --> 00:37:18,880
through a benefit performance.

658
00:37:19,140 --> 00:37:20,630
But Chu Yuan was threatened.

659
00:37:20,740 --> 00:37:21,440
He doesn't dare write anymore.

660
00:37:21,530 --> 00:37:21,820
All right.

661
00:37:22,400 --> 00:37:22,840
Let's drop it.

662
00:37:24,240 --> 00:37:26,150
It's only natural he'd do that.

663
00:37:26,640 --> 00:37:27,240
Quite understandable.

664
00:37:28,120 --> 00:37:29,070
By the way, Director Liang.

665
00:37:29,770 --> 00:37:30,480
Miss Ye

666
00:37:30,560 --> 00:37:31,850
once revised our script, right?

667
00:37:32,400 --> 00:37:33,950
Her writing and themes were better.

668
00:37:34,710 --> 00:37:35,190
This time,

669
00:37:35,270 --> 00:37:36,510
could you help us again?

670
00:37:43,740 --> 00:37:44,440
Pingjun

671
00:37:45,080 --> 00:37:46,200
has her own plans.

672
00:37:46,670 --> 00:37:47,580
But if the vote this week

673
00:37:47,580 --> 00:37:48,420
doesn't pass,

674
00:37:48,760 --> 00:37:50,070
all those refugees will be driven out.

675
00:37:50,660 --> 00:37:51,980
Once left homeless,

676
00:37:51,980 --> 00:37:53,130
the old, the weak, women, and children

677
00:37:53,330 --> 00:37:54,530
will hardly survive.

678
00:37:54,840 --> 00:37:55,220
Ruoru,

679
00:37:56,030 --> 00:37:56,780
don't force her into it.

680
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:58,390
We'll manage

681
00:37:58,390 --> 00:37:59,590
to solve this.

682
00:38:00,420 --> 00:38:01,750
I'll pawn some things first.

683
00:38:02,180 --> 00:38:03,320
Even if it's just a drop in the bucket,

684
00:38:03,840 --> 00:38:05,110
at least it can help the refugees

685
00:38:05,340 --> 00:38:06,180
settle for a few more days.

686
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:07,670
Okay.

687
00:38:07,920 --> 00:38:08,570
We'll be going then.

688
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:09,000
Let's go.

689
00:38:09,680 --> 00:38:10,280
Director Liang.

690
00:38:16,020 --> 00:38:16,760
I want to give it a try.

691
00:38:20,750 --> 00:38:21,400
Aren't you afraid?

692
00:38:22,230 --> 00:38:23,030
It's dangerous,

693
00:38:23,360 --> 00:38:24,570
but things worth doing

694
00:38:24,580 --> 00:38:25,590
must be done.

695
00:38:26,540 --> 00:38:28,540
These refugees lost their homes

696
00:38:28,910 --> 00:38:30,360
and their loved ones

697
00:38:30,590 --> 00:38:31,400
because of the war.

698
00:38:33,240 --> 00:38:34,280
I want to do something

699
00:38:35,030 --> 00:38:36,490
to see if I can help them.

700
00:38:53,670 --> 00:38:54,280
Come in.

701
00:39:00,480 --> 00:39:00,940
Father.

702
00:39:04,830 --> 00:39:05,120
Father.

703
00:39:09,390 --> 00:39:10,420
Good.

704
00:39:11,250 --> 00:39:13,480
Even those around Mr. Cheng

705
00:39:14,020 --> 00:39:15,970
are speaking and acting for you.

706
00:39:17,490 --> 00:39:19,590
Your reach is not only long,

707
00:39:19,760 --> 00:39:21,050
but it's pretty high.

708
00:39:21,580 --> 00:39:22,880
To reach even higher,

709
00:39:23,600 --> 00:39:24,830
you naturally need a ladder.

710
00:39:25,360 --> 00:39:27,970
But this is playing with fire.

711
00:39:28,340 --> 00:39:29,880
You exposed Chu Wenfu,

712
00:39:30,580 --> 00:39:31,420
but you also

713
00:39:31,420 --> 00:39:33,180
put yourself in Mr. Cheng's sights.

714
00:39:33,720 --> 00:39:35,260
The people around Mr. Cheng

715
00:39:35,260 --> 00:39:36,440
are exceptionally sharp.

716
00:39:37,040 --> 00:39:38,340
One careless move,

717
00:39:39,280 --> 00:39:40,680
one mistake they can pin on you,

718
00:39:42,180 --> 00:39:43,440
can get you killed.

719
00:39:43,940 --> 00:39:45,280
When you secured Nanhuai,

720
00:39:45,780 --> 00:39:47,550
were you just as cautious

721
00:39:47,760 --> 00:39:48,560
in everything?

722
00:39:49,550 --> 00:39:50,220
Arrogant.

723
00:39:50,820 --> 00:39:51,550
Now,

724
00:39:51,560 --> 00:39:53,380
you can't take my advice anymore?

725
00:39:53,890 --> 00:39:54,200
I wouldn't dare.

726
00:39:56,300 --> 00:39:57,260
But before,

727
00:39:58,750 --> 00:39:59,980
you rarely gave me guidance.

728
00:40:01,440 --> 00:40:02,190
I'm not used to it.

729
00:40:09,170 --> 00:40:09,660
Come here.

730
00:40:16,830 --> 00:40:18,060
See this map?

731
00:40:18,530 --> 00:40:20,280
To our northeast

732
00:40:20,360 --> 00:40:21,140
is Chu Wenfu.

733
00:40:21,670 --> 00:40:23,520
To the southwest is the Mu Army.

734
00:40:23,840 --> 00:40:25,000
Here is the Jing Army.

735
00:40:25,920 --> 00:40:27,240
Here is the Northwest Army.

736
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:31,030
Our Nanhuai is surrounded on all sides.

737
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:35,180
Before, they dismissed you
as a spoiled heir.

738
00:40:35,740 --> 00:40:37,420
Now, you're their opponent.

739
00:40:37,920 --> 00:40:39,860
One of your feet is on a tightrope.

740
00:40:40,080 --> 00:40:41,940
And below are formidable dangers.

741
00:40:42,590 --> 00:40:43,130
So,

742
00:40:44,360 --> 00:40:46,000
don't underestimate the enemy.

743
00:40:46,340 --> 00:40:48,210
Don't let your guard down.

744
00:40:48,860 --> 00:40:49,350
Understand?

745
00:40:54,980 --> 00:40:55,340
Mr. Yu.

746
00:40:57,960 --> 00:40:59,100
From the discipline sweep,

747
00:40:59,660 --> 00:41:00,700
three regiment commanders

748
00:41:00,700 --> 00:41:01,790
embezzled military funds over the years,

749
00:41:02,470 --> 00:41:03,430
down to company commanders

750
00:41:03,750 --> 00:41:04,110
and platoon leaders.

751
00:41:04,360 --> 00:41:05,000
Twenty-one in total.

752
00:41:05,400 --> 00:41:06,060
Keep digging.

753
00:41:06,990 --> 00:41:08,380
Their dirty deeds over the years

754
00:41:08,380 --> 00:41:09,150
go far beyond this.

755
00:41:10,090 --> 00:41:10,550
Yes.

756
00:41:21,860 --> 00:41:23,650
Well, something just came up.

757
00:41:25,660 --> 00:41:26,070
Go on.

758
00:41:27,560 --> 00:41:29,200
That young lover of yours?

759
00:41:29,750 --> 00:41:29,980
She...

760
00:41:31,990 --> 00:41:32,650
What's with that look?

761
00:41:36,430 --> 00:41:37,290
Miss Ye.

762
00:41:38,130 --> 00:41:38,990
I heard

763
00:41:39,180 --> 00:41:40,320
she's formally submitted

764
00:41:40,520 --> 00:41:42,400
her resignation to Lanqing.

765
00:41:47,020 --> 00:41:47,760
But then,

766
00:41:48,880 --> 00:41:50,120
with Liang Wenbo's

767
00:41:50,120 --> 00:41:51,500
warm invitation,

768
00:41:52,270 --> 00:41:53,340
she stayed after all.

769
00:41:54,100 --> 00:41:54,800
No wonder they say

770
00:41:54,800 --> 00:41:56,550
Director Liang has such pull.

771
00:41:56,720 --> 00:41:59,440
A warm breeze wins hearts.

772
00:42:01,310 --> 00:42:02,590
Li Boren, don't you have work to do?

773
00:42:03,070 --> 00:42:03,390
You...

774
00:42:03,820 --> 00:42:05,040
What? Isn't this important?

775
00:42:05,320 --> 00:42:05,560
It's...

776
00:42:06,550 --> 00:42:07,840
Right, that reminds me.

777
00:42:08,910 --> 00:42:09,630
Today,

778
00:42:09,780 --> 00:42:10,220
aren't you going

779
00:42:10,220 --> 00:42:11,440
to meet that arms dealer?

780
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:12,670
Rob something?

781
00:42:12,850 --> 00:42:13,440
Robert.

782
00:42:13,870 --> 00:42:15,220
Yes, it's Robert.

783
00:42:15,560 --> 00:42:16,460
Aren't you treating him to dinner?

784
00:42:17,040 --> 00:42:18,630
He wants to go to Baosheng Hotel.

785
00:42:19,000 --> 00:42:19,840
No good private rooms left.

786
00:42:20,080 --> 00:42:21,340
So, I moved the booking

787
00:42:21,910 --> 00:42:24,530
to the Hsiang Hsi Hotel.

788
00:42:25,440 --> 00:42:25,820
How's that?

789
00:42:30,800 --> 00:42:31,400
Mr. Yu,

790
00:42:31,750 --> 00:42:32,880
Germany will also ship

791
00:42:32,880 --> 00:42:34,480
two hundred Mauser C96s.

792
00:42:34,770 --> 00:42:35,480
Once they arrive at the port,

793
00:42:35,480 --> 00:42:36,780
I'll notify you immediately.

794
00:42:37,270 --> 00:42:37,940
I appreciate it.

795
00:42:38,750 --> 00:42:40,100
Doing business with you

796
00:42:40,100 --> 00:42:41,130
is my honor.

797
00:42:41,650 --> 00:42:42,980
The firearms specialist you need

798
00:42:43,140 --> 00:42:44,890
will arrive in Nanhuai soon.

799
00:42:45,730 --> 00:42:46,290
You've been very helpful.

800
00:42:46,760 --> 00:42:47,130
Ruitong,

801
00:42:47,610 --> 00:42:48,570
see Robert out.

802
00:42:49,300 --> 00:42:49,870
Thank you, Mr. Yu.

803
00:42:50,170 --> 00:42:51,160
I look forward to next time.

804
00:42:52,280 --> 00:42:52,560
After you.

805
00:42:56,600 --> 00:42:57,120
Well?

806
00:42:57,450 --> 00:42:57,980
The results

807
00:42:57,980 --> 00:42:58,470
are not bad, right?

808
00:42:59,940 --> 00:43:00,360
Mr. Yu.

809
00:43:02,390 --> 00:43:03,420
Everything's all settled?

810
00:43:03,870 --> 00:43:04,530
What brings you here?

811
00:43:05,980 --> 00:43:07,320
I've got a few dishes ready at my place.

812
00:43:07,680 --> 00:43:09,120
I also just got a new black fox cloak.

813
00:43:09,500 --> 00:43:10,110
Go try it on.

814
00:43:11,860 --> 00:43:13,040
I don't need one of those.

815
00:43:13,270 --> 00:43:14,180
Why spend the money?

816
00:43:14,800 --> 00:43:15,550
Don't stand on ceremony.

817
00:43:15,770 --> 00:43:17,240
Everything I earn comes from you.

818
00:43:17,490 --> 00:43:17,920
Let's go.

819
00:43:18,820 --> 00:43:19,780
Let's go take a look.

820
00:43:20,560 --> 00:43:21,590
As for that cloak,

821
00:43:21,730 --> 00:43:22,580
any share for me?

822
00:43:23,310 --> 00:43:23,980
Come along, then.

823
00:43:24,020 --> 00:43:24,340
Sure.

824
00:43:37,400 --> 00:43:38,120
It's so late.

825
00:43:38,320 --> 00:43:39,370
The troupe is still here.

826
00:43:40,990 --> 00:43:42,480
They've been coming and going lately.

827
00:43:42,710 --> 00:43:43,500
They seem to be

828
00:43:43,740 --> 00:43:44,980
preparing an important show.

829
00:43:55,380 --> 00:43:56,320
Pingjun, look.

830
00:43:57,380 --> 00:43:58,180
I've added a contrast

831
00:43:58,420 --> 00:43:59,660
to this part.

832
00:44:00,510 --> 00:44:01,230
What do you think?

833
00:44:02,030 --> 00:44:02,800
I think

834
00:44:02,800 --> 00:44:04,710
adding the choice to fight or not

835
00:44:04,980 --> 00:44:06,650
sharpens the focus

836
00:44:06,990 --> 00:44:08,620
and deepens the emotion.

837
00:44:09,150 --> 00:44:10,230
That's exactly right.

838
00:44:10,480 --> 00:44:11,350
You really get me.

839
00:44:11,350 --> 00:44:12,130
That's just what I meant.

840
00:44:12,140 --> 00:44:12,550
Right?

841
00:44:14,320 --> 00:44:15,030
For the next scene,

842
00:44:15,420 --> 00:44:16,730
I want him to say this line

843
00:44:17,070 --> 00:44:18,510
at the school gate.

844
00:44:20,000 --> 00:44:20,960
Let me see.

845
00:44:22,620 --> 00:44:24,070
Director Liang, Pingjun.

846
00:44:26,580 --> 00:44:27,330
Lanqing.

847
00:44:27,710 --> 00:44:28,190
Mr. Yu.

848
00:44:28,720 --> 00:44:29,290
Staff Officer Li.

849
00:44:34,080 --> 00:44:34,800
Liang Wenbo.

850
00:44:35,200 --> 00:44:35,730
Ye Pingjun.

851
00:44:36,400 --> 00:44:37,400
It's so late.

852
00:44:37,710 --> 00:44:38,670
What are you two doing here?

853
00:44:39,360 --> 00:44:40,110
We are

854
00:44:40,110 --> 00:44:40,890
revising the script.

855
00:44:41,000 --> 00:44:42,000
What scene needs

856
00:44:42,010 --> 00:44:42,940
late-night rewrites?

857
00:44:45,760 --> 00:44:47,150
What are you looking at? Say it.

858
00:44:48,480 --> 00:44:48,800
Fine.

859
00:44:49,320 --> 00:44:49,840
Then let me ask you.

860
00:44:50,130 --> 00:44:51,120
Where are the others?

861
00:44:51,710 --> 00:44:52,480
Why are you two

862
00:44:52,480 --> 00:44:53,360
alone here?

863
00:44:53,440 --> 00:44:54,800
The stage area lost power earlier.

864
00:44:55,280 --> 00:44:56,440
The other performers went home.

865
00:44:56,550 --> 00:44:57,550
Only Pingjun and I stayed behind

866
00:44:57,670 --> 00:44:58,820
and revised the script together.

867
00:44:59,480 --> 00:45:00,190
I think

868
00:45:00,630 --> 00:45:01,920
you're using the script revision

869
00:45:01,920 --> 00:45:02,800
as a cover for flirting.

870
00:45:04,670 --> 00:45:05,920
We were only working.

871
00:45:06,280 --> 00:45:07,190
There was nothing improper.

872
00:45:07,660 --> 00:45:08,550
A filthy mind sees filth

873
00:45:08,940 --> 00:45:10,490
in everything, of course.

874
00:45:10,790 --> 00:45:11,710
I'm the one with a filthy mind?

875
00:45:12,210 --> 00:45:13,190
She called me filthy.

876
00:45:13,790 --> 00:45:15,280
When you went boating with me,

877
00:45:15,910 --> 00:45:17,320
you could barely stay on the boat,

878
00:45:18,680 --> 00:45:19,840
saying that being alone with me

879
00:45:19,840 --> 00:45:20,720
in the same room

880
